      "uid": "zhcn:01beb2909c926629fe6c3f8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对樱花进王这个短途马来说，\n专为长距离跑者设计的特训恐怕是太严苛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ecd100e681f5f9be379f0690237b297db844df3aeb53db6374af8394ad96ace",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
