    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44a70a243564ac8a9e9a7024",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然已经如此决定，\n首先就得掌握樱花进王的同学有多少实力，\n以及她有什么跑步习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e72787b359c4241dc4a2dea337b4fe0b853cfc5350cd01e249820655bfb57f3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041702.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbe2bd428c74ec4a44c13bdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
